  "description": "Browser tests against your own ASP.NET Core API with XUnitAssured.Playwright: a fixture that hosts the API on a real port with WebApplicationFactory and serves a built front-end on another, so browser tests run with dotnet test alone — in CI, with real cross-origin rules.",
